description: |
  :ref:`/plugins/prepare/artifact` plugin will now enforce installing a specific
  NVR of a package when ``verify`` is passed and there is a unique package in the
  artifact provider set to choose from. This effectively replaces the requested
  package (or equivalent matching request) from the test's
  :tmt:story:`/spec/tests/require` or :tmt:story:`/spec/tests/recommend` list.
